---
import Base from '../layouts/base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy — Robin Foster">
  <header>
    <h1 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy <span class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">✦</span></h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
      This page is the privacy policy for Robin Foster's personal Google OAuth apps.
      The current app is a personal assistant that connects to Google Calendar.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="mt-6">
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">What data is used <span class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">✦</span></h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">
      The assistant requests access only to your Google Calendar. It reads your
      calendar events and creates events on your behalf — for example, recurring
      workout blocks and weekly outlook summaries.
    </p>
  </section>

  <ul class="mt-6 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-slate-700">
    <li>Google data is used only for the functionality described when the app requests access.</li>
    <li>Data is not sold, shared with third parties, or used for advertising.</li>
    <li>Calendar data is processed on private personal infrastructure and is not stored beyond what the app needs to function.</li>
    <li>You can revoke access at any time in your Google account settings.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="mt-6 text-slate-700">Contact: via GitHub, or the email listed on the home page.</p>
</Base>
